   "text": "The map said three miles, so Maya planned ninety minutes.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.338
  },
  {
   "text": "In fresh snow it took three hours, and the sun was low.",
   "start": 3.538,
   "end": 6.576
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix: in snow, plan for double the time,",
   "start": 6.876,
   "end": 9.499
